* @title Overlapping pattern match with &FULLSCAN
* @attribution Griswold 1971, Appendix D
* @expect >>>
* NO MATCH
* <<<
         &FULLSCAN = 1
         ABC = POS(0) (SPAN('A') @N SPAN('B') POS(*(2 * N)) RPOS(*N) SPAN('C') RPOS(0))
         'AABBBBCC' ABC                        :S(MATCH)
         OUTPUT = 'NO MATCH'                   :(END)
MATCH    OUTPUT = 'MATCH FOUND AT N=' N
END
